        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Finding the right pair of glasses shouldn’t feel like a hassle. Whether you need something for everyday wear, work, or just a fresh new look, we’re here to make the process simple. At our <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Pine Beach optical</a>, we help you find glasses that feel good and fit your life, without overcomplicating things. Visit Academy Vision for your next pair.</p>",
