      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Choosing glasses isn’t just about picking a frame off the shelf. Our Pine Beach opticians take the time to understand how you use your eyes daily, whether you’re working on a screen, driving, reading, or always on the go. From there, we guide you toward options that fit your vision, comfort, and style. No pressure, no guesswork—just help that makes sense.</p><h3>Same-Day Glasses Available</h3><p>Sometimes you don’t want to wait days or weeks for your new glasses. With our in-office finishing lab in Pine Beach, many prescriptions can be made the very same day. That means you can come in for your <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exam</a>, pick out your frames, and leave with your new glasses in hand. It’s quick, convenient, and one less thing to worry about.</p>",
          "id": "DNVDxfnSUS",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
