          "html": "<p>We carry a wide selection of frames for every age and style. Whether you’re looking for something classic, modern, or a little bolder, we’ll help you find a pair that feels like you. And if you’re bringing your kids in, we make it easy to find comfortable, durable options.</p><h3>Kids’ Frames That Fit Their Life</h3><p>Kids need glasses that can keep up with them. We offer frames that are lightweight, flexible, and designed to stay comfortable throughout the day. With a range of fun styles and trusted brands, we’ll help your child find something they actually want to wear.</p>",
          "id": "ERI23yWJC0",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
