          "text": "Lens Options That Make a Difference",
          "html": "Lens Options That Make a Difference",
          "id": "u5N8a2SQFI",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>The right lenses can make a big difference in how your glasses feel throughout the day. We’ll help you choose options that match your routine, whether that means reducing glare, protecting your eyes from screens, or improving clarity in bright light. It’s all about making your vision more comfortable, not more complicated.</p><ul><li>Anti-reflective coatings to reduce glare and eye strain</li><li>Blue light protection for screen-heavy days</li><li>Polarized lenses for clearer vision outdoors</li><li>Scratch-resistant treatments for everyday durability</li></ul>",
          "id": "N4sRIQnKKP",
