        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>You’ll find us right on Route 9 near the Mizzen Avenue light. Patients from Pine Beach, Beachwood, Toms River, and nearby communities stop in because they know they’ll get honest recommendations and help that actually makes sense. After more than 40 years, we’ve kept things simple: take care of people, and they’ll keep coming back.</p><p>Whether you know exactly what you’re looking for or want a little help figuring it out, we’re here for you. Stop by, bring the family, or come in on your own; we’ll make the process easy and help you find something you feel good wearing every day.</p>",
